      {
        "author_name": "Tristan Farrugia",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113634243551907419190/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKVwn_qbF5CunmNwJlUJoVoyHL5c7Jx4n8zwkcr6JFP2IZSCg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Atrocious experience with Fariba Khodayar who represented a very aggressive and paranoid owner for the sale of a property in Sherbrooke. Fariba did not deign to travel for this meeting. Upon our entry, this owner mistook my partner for someone she did not want to sell to. This person called Fariba on the phone to try to sort out the situation and she demonstrated a total lack of professionalism towards us by making no attempt to defuse the situation with the seller she represents. After being chased off the property, we called to speak to Fariba's superior named Jean-Pierre and he was even worse, showing no responsibility towards his broker and no empathy for the situation but questioning why Fariba, who works in Vaudreuil-Dorion, represents clients in Sherbrooke when she cannot be present at the visits. Nightmarish experience worthy of a horror movie. Needless to say, we do not recommend this agency in any way.",
        "time": 1741493312,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "SHAB khosravi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106851685829156016263/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLJf_wc6ujJM5wRIbyi7jq5U_f4Q4C5BqCjH-S-F_oZxo2LIYg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Bad experience as a potential buyer of a property located in Sherbrooke. Broker Fariba Khodayar did not show up for the visit. We were greeted by the seller. The seller accused us of having already made an offer to purchase and that it had been refused. They were mistaken, the person. Broker Fariba knew that the seller had chosen the wrong person, but did not give the seller any explanation. We were invaded by their arguments in neither English nor French. Fariba was unable to explain to us in either French or English. We experienced a huge trauma. No sympathy from her group superior after speaking. Very disappointed with our choice of property. Not recommended!",
        "time": 1741496553,
        "translated": true
      }
